      "status": "completed",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "output_text",
          "text": "**The work order and Pending Close time are confirmed, but the event-level finding remains unverified because access to the supporting records was denied.**\n\n| Requested item | Finding |\n|---|---|\n| Manufacturing order | **MO-25-09-1070** |\n| Work order ID | **WO-2025-09-004** |\n| Operation / product | Racine–Dekoven / Cooler Plate Pack |\n| September cost period | **Sep-25 — PER-COST-2025-09** |\n| Exact Pending Close time | **2025-09-30T18:00:00** |\n| Source transaction | Not verifiable from accessible records |\n| Event amount | Not verifiable |\n| Exact event-created time | Not verifiable |\n| Minutes after Pending Close | Cannot calculate without the event-created time |\n| Recorded accounting status | Not verifiable |\n| Status consistent with Oracle policy? | Cannot conclude without the event record and event type |\n\nThe accessible extract contains work orders and cost periods but **no cost-event rows**. This is an evidence gap—not proof that no late event occurred. The Pending Close timestamp has no timezone or UTC offset in the source.\n\n### Oracle policy\nOracle Fusion Cloud SCM Cost Management 26B, **“Cost Accounting Period Statuses and Transaction Accounting,” PDF page 233 / printed page 225**, states that new transactions created after Pending Close, relating to the current or a prior period, are not staged or processed until the period is closed or reopened. Transactions entered before Pending Close continue processing. **Revenue lines, COGS recognition, and manual cost adjustments are exceptions** that continue processing after Pending Close.\n\nAccordingly, a newly created, non-exempt transaction after **2025-09-30T18:00:00** should be held from processing. I cannot determine whether the event’s recorded status follows that rule without authorized event-level evidence.\n\nNo database records were changed. The partial audit and provenance were saved, and the submitted report is marked **needs evidence**.",
          "annotations": [],
          "logprobs": []
        }
      ],
      "phase": "final_answer"
    }
  ],
